<p class="wp-block-paragraph">You can capture ideas in Outline mode on the outer display, then unfold the phone for a larger mind-mapping canvas. Side by Side lets you work with both views without switching between them.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">I&#8217;m really looking forward to seeing what productivity app developers do with the iPhone Duo.</p>
